      "description": "Introductory note and 40 essays (the 'My Six Conversions' series grouped as one part); site furniture and contents dropped. The text in sources/en-US-originals/ is the plain-text extraction of the page's paragraphs and headings (HTML tags removed). Titles set in title case from the transcription's capitals.",
